.Dd August 23, 2026
.Dt PQFREEBSD_COMPAT_ZFS_MULTILABEL 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel
.Nd set MNT_MULTILABEL on ZFS mounts with xattr enabled
.Sh SYNOPSIS
ZFS hosts only.
Prefer
.Xr loader.conf 5 :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pqfreebsd_load="YES"
pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel_load="YES"
.Ed
.Pp
Or at run time after
.Xr pqfreebsd 4 :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
kldload pqfreebsd_compat_zfs_multilabel
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a
.Em ZFS-only
compat module for the
.Nm pqfreebsd
project
.Pq pqk .
Legacy UFS/FFS already sets
.Dv MNT_MULTILABEL
and never had this regression.
OpenZFS mounts that omit the flag receive it when the effective
.Cm xattr
property is
.Cm on
.Pq also
.Cm dir
or
.Cm sa
.Pq local or inherited .
A proper fix will go upstream.
.Pp
On
.Dv MOD_LOAD
the module registers a
.Dv vfs_mounted
handler and scans active ZFS mounts.
Each mount newly marked emits a
.Xr log 9
.Dv LOG_INFO
line.
The handler is dropped in
.Dv MOD_QUIESCE .
.Pp
This module depends on
.Nm pqfreebsd
and
.Nm zfsctrl
via
.Fn MODULE_DEPEND .
.Xr pqfreebsd 4
does not load it;
pqf skills or
.Xr loader 8
do when ZFS is in play.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac 4 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 4 ,
.Xr loader.conf 5 ,
.Xr kldload 8 ,
.Xr mount 8 ,
.Xr zfs 8 ,
.Xr log 9
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Brian Fundakowski Feldman
.Sh LICENSE
Light-ware License.
Copyright (c) 2026 Brian Fundakowski Feldman.
.Sh BUGS
Does not clear
.Dv MNT_MULTILABEL
on unload.
Remounts that change
.Cm xattr
are not observed until reload or a new mount.
